{"ticker":"OTIS","updated":"2026-10-30T23:04:02Z","profile":{"longName":"Otis Worldwide Corporation","shortName":"Otis Worldwide Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.otis.com","fullTimeEmployees":72000,"marketCap":28835702784,"trailingPE":18.843285,"forwardPE":16.85142,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.9052331,"pegRatio":1.69,"targetMeanPrice":86.46154,"targetHighPrice":100.0,"targetLowPrice":73.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.061,"earningsGrowth":0.137,"grossMargins":0.30155,"operatingMargins":0.15841,"profitMargins":0.10281,"totalRevenue":15134999552,"beta":0.859,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":94.565,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":63.575,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.36},"summary":"Otis Worldwide Corporation engages in manufacturing, installation, and servicing of elevators and escalators in the United States, China, and internationally. The company operates in two segments, New Equipment and Service. The New Equipment segment designs, manufactures, sells, and installs a range of passenger and freight elevators, as well as escalators and moving walkways for residential and commercial buildings, and infrastructure projects. This segment serves real-estate and building developers, and general contractors. It sells its products directly to customers, as well as through agents and distributors. The Service segment performs maintenance and repair services, as well as modernization services to upgrade elevators and escalators. Otis Worldwide Corporation was founded in 1853 and is headquartered in Farmington, Connecticut.","summary_zh":"奧的斯全球公司在美國、中國和國際上從事電梯和自動扶梯的製造、安裝和服務。該公司分為兩個部門：新設備部門和服務部門。新設備部門為住宅和商業建築以及基礎設施項目設計、製造、銷售和安裝一系列客運和貨運電梯以及自動扶梯和自動人行道。該部門為房地產和建築開發商以及總承包商提供服務。它直接向客戶銷售產品，也透過代理商和分銷商銷售產品。服務部門提供維護和維修服務，以及升級電梯和自動扶梯的現代化服務。奧的斯全球公司成立於 1853 年，總部位於康乃狄克州法明頓。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-0