tps://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1781335/000178133526000011/otis-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Otis is the world's leading elevator and escalator manufacturing, installation, service and modernization company. We serve customers in over 200 countries and territories around the world. Otis has global scale and local focus, with more than 1,400 branches and offices, and a direct physical presence in more than 70 countries.","zh":"奧的斯是世界領先的電梯和自動扶梯製造、安裝、服務和現代化公司。我們為全球 200 多個國家和地區的客戶提供服務。奧的斯擁有全球規模和在地化優勢，擁有 1,400 多個分支機構和辦事處，並在 70 多個國家/地區設有直接實體機構。"},{"en":"The following description of our business should be read in conjunction with Item 7 in this Form 10-K, including the information contained therein under the heading \"Business Overview.\"","zh":"以下對我們業務的描述應與本表 10-K 中的第 7 項一起閱讀，包括其中「業務概述」標題下包含的資訊。"},{"en":"Our Company is organized into two segments, New Equipment and Service, which, for 2025, contributed 35% and 65% of our net sales, and 9% and 91% of our segment operating profit, respectively. Our international operations represented approximately 71% of our net sales for 2025.","zh":"我們公司分為新設備和服務兩個部門，到 2025 年，這兩個部門分別占我們淨銷售額的 35% 和 65%，以及我們部門營業利潤的 9% 和 91%。 2025 年，我們的國際業務約佔淨銷售額的 71%。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"New Equipment orders are generally delivered within 12 months of booking, although larger projects can take longer to deliver based on customer construction schedules, and in some regions, mostly in China, the order to delivery window is shorter. When placing New Equipment orders, customers typically make an advance payment to cover costs including design and contract engineering. These advance payments are typically followed by periodic progress payments at specified milestones, such as delivery of materials at the job site and completion of installation and equipment commissioning. Installation is carried out by our installation technicians or through subcontractors, in which case we typically complete the final inspection and commissioning to ensure that our quality standards are met. Revenues are recognized based on percentage of completion. Once commissioned, New Equipment units are","zh":"新設備訂單通常在預訂後 12 個月內交付，但根據客戶施工計劃，較大的項目可能需要更長的時間才能交付，並且在某些地區（主要是中國），訂單到交付窗口較短。在下新設備訂單時，客戶通常會預付款以支付包括設計和合約工程在內的成本。在這些預付款之後，通常會在指定的里程碑定期支付進度付款，例如在工作現場交付材料以及完成安裝和設備調試。安裝由我們的安裝技術人員或透過分包商進行，在這種情況下，我們通常會完成最終檢查和調試，以確保符合我們的品質標準。收入根據完成百分比確認。新設備單位投入使用後"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a highly competitive industry. Due to the global and localized nature of the industry, there are numerous participants of varying size that operate in our industry. According to industry estimates, there are hundreds of participants that offer New Equipment solutions and several thousand participants that offer maintenance and service solutions. In both the New Equipment and Service segments, major competitors globally include KONE Oyj, Schindler Group and TK Elevator, while there are a number of additional competitors in the Asia Pacific region. Competitive dynamics vary significantly by segment and geography. In the Service segment, independent service providers and other small operators are significant competitors in most of our local geographies. These independent service providers have an aggregate portfolio of about 50% of service units, but account for a smaller perc","zh":"我們所處的行業競爭非常激烈。由於該行業的全球性和本地化性質，我們行業中有許多不同規模的參與者。根據業界估計，提供新設備解決方案的參與者有數百家，提供維護和服務解決方案的參與者有數千家。在新設備和服務領域，全球主要競爭對手包括通力集團、迅達集團和TK Elevator，而亞太地區還有許多其他競爭對手。競爭動態因細分市場和地理位置的不同而有顯著差異。在服務領域，獨立服務提供者和其他小型業者是我們大多數當地地區的重要競爭對手。這些獨立服務提供者的總投資組合約佔服務單位的 50%，但比例較小"},{"en":"There are several factors that determine competitiveness in the industry, including local codes and compliance requirements, customer preferences, price, reputation, delivery and execution, product quality, equipment performance, reliability and long-term service and product support. Our success in both our New Equipment and Service segments depends upon our ability to develop and market our products, services and solutions, as well as our ability to provide the people, technologies, facilities, equipment and financial capacity needed to deliver those products and services with maximum efficiency and at quality levels expected by our customers. We believe our global presence, local relationships and proven track record in executing complex elevator and escalator solutions contribute to our iconic brand, reputation and competitive position in the industry.","zh":"決定行業競爭力的因素有很多，包括當地法規和合規要求、客戶偏好、價格、聲譽、交付和執行、產品品質、設備性能、可靠性以及長期服務和產品支援。我們在新設備和服務領域的成功取決於我們開發和行銷我們的產品、服務和解決方案的能力，以及我們提供所需人員、技術、設施、設備和財務能力的能力，以最高效率和客戶期望的品質水準提供這些產品和服務。我們相信，我們的全球影響力、本地關係以及在執行複雜電梯和自動扶梯解決方案方面的良好業績記錄有助於我們在行業中的標誌性品牌、聲譽和競爭地位。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Services","val":9442000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"New Equipment","val":4989000000,"zh":"新設備"}],"total":14431000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":9442000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Service Maintenance & Repair","val":7584000000,"zh":"服務維護和維修"},{"name":"Service Modernization","val":1858000000,"zh":"服務現代化"}],"total":14431000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Other","val":8589000000,"zh":"其他"},{"name":"US","val":4192000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CN","val":1650000000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":14431000000}},"peers":["CARR","TT","RTX","FTV","CTVA"]}}